<title>USA: TABLE- PartnerRe Ltd issues $250 mln prefd.</title>
<headline>TABLE- PartnerRe Ltd issues $250 mln prefd.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of cumulative preferred stock from PartnerRe Ltd was priced on Tuesday via joint lead managers Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co and Smith Barney Inc, PartnerRe said.</p>
<p>The issue was made in connection with PartnerRe's acquisition of French reinsurer Societe Anonyme Francaise de Reassurances (SAFR), the company said.</p>
<p>BORROWER PARTNER RE LTD</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	  DIV YLD 8.00 PCT  MATURITY PERPETUAL</p>
<p>TYPE CUMULATIVE PFD ISS PRICE $25     FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S a1     NO. SHARES 10 MLN PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A</p>
<p>NOTES: Priced as 10 million $25 shares.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
